Author: Konata <konata@KonatadeMacBook-Pro.local>
Date:   Thu Aug 27 12:01:13 2026 +0800

    feat(fe,panels,stores): restore device connect/disconnect controls
    
    Bring back the connection status dot and Power button on sidebar device rows,
    the Connect link on device cards and the disconnected placeholder in the
    console. Connection intent lives in GlobalDeviceProvider (persisted
    tmex:connectedDevices / tmex:disconnectedDevices) and reaches the embeddable
    panels through an optional DeviceConnectionAdapter prop; explicit disconnect
    suppresses route/expansion auto-subscribe until the user reconnects.
    disconnectDevice now flips deviceConnected immediately.
    
    Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01Y3oYTN2vgHrHcmXgStDSC5

